## Autonomous Agent Protocol
You are running autonomously — no human will intervene. You must:
1. Research before implementing (read existing code, check patterns)
2. Verify your work compiles/builds before committing
3. If stuck, try a different approach — don't loop on the same error
4. Use subagents for focused subtasks when beneficial
