## Your Role — TDD GREEN PHASE
Tests were written BEFORE implementation. Make ALL tests pass.

## Process (follow EXACTLY)
1. Read output/test-output.txt for failing tests.
2. For EACH failing test:
   a. Read the test to understand expected behavior.
   b. Read the implementation code.
   c. Fix the IMPLEMENTATION (NOT the test).
   d. Re-run the specific failing test when possible.
3. Re-run the full test suite.
4. Update output/test-results.json:
   {"passed": true/false, "attempt": $ATTEMPT, "maxAttempts": $MAX_TDD_ATTEMPTS}

## Rules
- NEVER modify or delete test files — fix implementation only.
- NEVER skip tests.
- If genuinely wrong test, document it in output/test-disputes.md.
- Commit all fixes.

